42,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"- **Victoria**: That confirms my fear. Permanent ownership breeds resentment. We need a system that keeps us talking, not just cleaning.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Rin,,"- **Rin**: So if we hire help, does that 2,300 yen disappear? I want to know if we save money or just pay more","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
