45,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,- **Ryuji**: The timing is brutal. Forty-seven minutes for the kitchen alone. I can't absorb that weekly.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Mio,,- **Mio**: I checked the calendar. Two of us are gone for weeks at a time. How can we rotate fairly if we're not even here?,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
