48,2,3,talk,Rin,,"- **Rin**: @Victoria, but if we pay someone, the money still has to come from our pockets. Who covers the gap when we're away?","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,-Daisuke: The grout was dirty again in eleven days. I can't keep guessing if it's safe to use.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,- **Ryuji**: The firm's terms require someone home for two hours. That defeats the purpose of removing the work from my schedule.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
